1
00:00:24,733 --> 00:00:27,066
I was thinking of inviting you
to visit my grandparents.

2
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,300
Hello.

3
00:00:28,866 --> 00:00:29,933
Did you bring your girlfriend?

4
00:00:30,266 --> 00:00:32,966
This is Ms. Chat, my boss.

5
00:00:33,166 --> 00:00:35,466
You suddenly brought me
all the way here.

6
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:37,666
What's your plan exactly?

7
00:00:38,133 --> 00:00:39,200
What plan, Boss?

8
00:00:39,666 --> 00:00:40,933
By the way, did you see your mother

9
00:00:41,766 --> 00:00:42,900
while you were there?

10
00:00:43,866 --> 00:00:48,133
So... What kind of person
is Nant's mother, anyway?

11
00:01:12,566 --> 00:01:14,049
Don't tease me.

12
00:01:14,571 --> 00:01:16,922
I'm trying to sleep.

13
00:01:19,466 --> 00:01:22,000
It's morning already, you sleepyhead.

14
00:01:24,466 --> 00:01:25,400
Wake up.

15
00:01:33,166 --> 00:01:34,400
You're up early.

16
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:42,762
Is there something on my face?

17
00:01:43,598 --> 00:01:47,133
Why are you staring
at me like that, Boss?

18
00:01:48,266 --> 00:01:49,700
You were drooling in your sleep.

19
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:52,133
Really?

20
00:01:52,966 --> 00:01:53,766
Oh!

21
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,266
Just kidding.

22
00:01:59,166 --> 00:02:00,866
You're so easy to fool.

23
00:02:01,533 --> 00:02:02,333
There's nothing.

24
00:02:02,533 --> 00:02:03,533
You can stop wiping your face now.

25
00:02:05,866 --> 00:02:07,700
You're already teasing me
so early in the morning, Boss.

26
00:02:09,766 --> 00:02:10,566
What?

27
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:12,366
Can't I tease you?

28
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,200
You're just...

29
00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:16,000
Too fun to tease.

30
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:23,700
Nant.

31
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:25,000
Yes?

32
00:02:25,766 --> 00:02:26,766
From now on...

33
00:02:27,866 --> 00:02:29,266
Whatever happens to you,

34
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,733
or whatever's bothering you,

35
00:02:32,933 --> 00:02:34,733
I want you to tell me about it.

36
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:38,066
I want to know everything about you.

37
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,400
Okay?

38
00:02:42,100 --> 00:02:42,900
Okay.

39
00:02:44,566 --> 00:02:46,400
Why is your voice so low?

40
00:02:47,900 --> 00:02:51,400
Are you hiding something from me?

41
00:02:52,366 --> 00:02:53,166
No.

42
00:02:54,166 --> 00:02:54,966
I'm not.

43
00:02:56,766 --> 00:02:58,400
Then promise me

44
00:02:59,133 --> 00:03:00,700
you'll tell me everything.

45
00:03:03,166 --> 00:03:03,966
Okay.

46
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:05,166
I promise.

47
00:03:06,333 --> 00:03:08,333
And you have to promise me too, Boss.

48
00:03:08,933 --> 00:03:11,366
You'll tell me everything as well.

49
00:03:12,133 --> 00:03:12,933
Mm-hmm.

50
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,600
I promise.

51
00:03:15,566 --> 00:03:16,366
Really?

52
00:03:16,766 --> 00:03:18,500
No keeping secrets from each other.

53
00:03:19,566 --> 00:03:20,366
Mm-hmm.

54
00:03:20,733 --> 00:03:21,533
Of course.

55
00:03:27,766 --> 00:03:30,766
Did you sleep well last night?

56
00:03:32,933 --> 00:03:33,733
Not at all.

57
00:03:35,066 --> 00:03:37,333
Why not?

58
00:03:38,866 --> 00:03:40,800
You kept crowding me all night.

59
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:44,166
Come on, the bed is tiny!

60
00:03:48,700 --> 00:03:49,533
How about this?

61
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:53,366
Should we try sleeping
in a different position?

62
00:03:55,733 --> 00:03:56,533
What position?

63
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:28,200
You're the one who asked for it, Nant.

64
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:36,611
Chat.

65
00:04:37,081 --> 00:04:38,666
It's still so early.

66
00:04:39,766 --> 00:04:41,566
Since when does this
kind of thing have a time limit?

67
00:06:31,466 --> 00:06:32,933
Massaging your grandpa
this early in the morning.

68
00:06:33,166 --> 00:06:33,966
What are you after?

69
00:06:35,733 --> 00:06:36,533
Wow!

70
00:06:37,366 --> 00:06:39,133
You always see
right through me, Grandpa.

71
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:40,700
Mm-hmm.

72
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:43,166
I've been meaning
to ask you since yesterday.

73
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:44,500
Is something going on?

74
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,133
Why did you bring
your boss to our house?

75
00:06:47,533 --> 00:06:53,466
Oh, I just brought Ms. Chat
to take a look at our land.

76
00:06:54,133 --> 00:06:55,166
To look at our land?

77
00:06:55,900 --> 00:06:56,700
Yes.

78
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,666
You wanted her to see it.

79
00:06:59,100 --> 00:07:00,766
What for?

80
00:07:01,933 --> 00:07:04,868
Well, right now...

81
00:07:04,868 --> 00:07:08,200
the company is looking for land
to grow bananas, Grandpa.

82
00:07:12,066 --> 00:07:13,666
Are you hiding something from me?

83
00:07:14,666 --> 00:07:16,900
No, I'm not.

84
00:07:18,966 --> 00:07:22,933
Then promise me
you'll tell me everything.

85
00:07:25,866 --> 00:07:28,400
So, now she saw it

86
00:07:28,666 --> 00:07:30,200
Does she like our land?

87
00:07:31,966 --> 00:07:32,766
Uh...

88
00:07:33,733 --> 00:07:35,700
She doesn't actually
know about this yet.

89
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,200
Oh.

90
00:07:38,766 --> 00:07:40,500
Won't she be upset

91
00:07:41,100 --> 00:07:42,266
if she finds out later?

92
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,000
Uh...

93
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:47,366
I'm not sure either, Grandpa.

94
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:51,766
Then why don't you
just tell her the truth?

95
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:55,900
If I tell her, Grandpa,

96
00:07:56,466 --> 00:07:59,333
I'll get an earful for two whole days.

97
00:08:00,966 --> 00:08:01,880
How about this...

98
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:05,200
I'll find the right time
to tell her later.

99
00:08:05,666 --> 00:08:06,466
Is that so?

100
00:08:06,866 --> 00:08:07,775
Yes.

101
00:08:07,775 --> 00:08:10,356
I'll handle this myself, Grandpa.

102
00:08:11,192 --> 00:08:13,884
Boss, look over there.

103
00:08:13,884 --> 00:08:18,066
Grandpa and Grandma used to
grow bananas all over this land.

104
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:22,100
But they don't do that anymore,

105
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:25,333
so it's gotten all overgrown.

106
00:08:27,300 --> 00:08:28,100
Why?

107
00:08:31,533 --> 00:08:34,600
Oh, I see.

108
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:42,066
Grandpa, I'm going to take a shower
and then head to the market.

109
00:08:43,066 --> 00:08:43,615
Go on, go on.

110
00:08:43,615 --> 00:08:44,400
Okay.

111
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:52,423
Boss!

112
00:08:53,468 --> 00:08:56,400
Come on, get dressed.
Let's go to the market.

113
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:57,978
Let's go to the village market.

114
00:08:57,978 --> 00:09:01,133
We'll buy some food
and cook lunch together.

115
00:09:05,133 --> 00:09:05,933
Boss.

116
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:07,916
No.

117
00:09:08,856 --> 00:09:09,870
You go with Grandpa.

118
00:09:10,654 --> 00:09:11,600
I don't want to go.

119
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,100
Huh?

120
00:09:14,929 --> 00:09:17,500
What's wrong, Boss?

121
00:09:19,966 --> 00:09:23,000
Nothing. I just don't feel like going.

122
00:09:24,466 --> 00:09:25,568
Oh, really?

123
00:09:26,561 --> 00:09:29,700
Then is there anything special
you'd like to eat?

124
00:09:31,866 --> 00:09:35,166
No. I'll be heading back
in a little while anyway.

125
00:09:37,566 --> 00:09:38,366
Oh, really?

126
00:09:41,466 --> 00:09:42,266
Okay.

127
00:09:43,066 --> 00:09:46,300
Then I'll go to the market first.

128
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:48,300
Mhm.

129
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:28,266
Is something wrong, Chat?

130
00:10:30,266 --> 00:10:32,621
Uh, no, Grandma.

131
00:10:33,143 --> 00:10:34,500
I'm perfectly fine.

132
00:10:36,966 --> 00:10:38,136
Nothing's wrong.

133
00:10:38,606 --> 00:10:39,725
But...

134
00:10:40,261 --> 00:10:45,113
I saw how coldly
you treated Nant just now.

135
00:10:46,576 --> 00:10:48,702
If something's bothering you, tell me.

136
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,533
I'm really fine, Grandma.

137
00:10:54,766 --> 00:10:56,700
It's just that now I realize...

138
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:59,766
we shouldn't
expect too much from anyone.

139
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:04,966
As long as you're okay.

140
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:15,000
There's something
I want to ask of you, Chat.

141
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:20,566
I want to entrust Nant to your care.

142
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:28,766
I don't think I can be entrusted
with your granddaughter anymore.

143
00:11:30,666 --> 00:11:31,638
It's okay.

144
00:11:32,004 --> 00:11:36,878
I know you're upset right now,

145
00:11:39,125 --> 00:11:44,559
but I don't want you
to misunderstand Nant.

146
00:11:47,866 --> 00:11:51,088
Some people think Nant

147
00:11:51,558 --> 00:11:54,187
is just a money-hungry girl.

148
00:11:55,075 --> 00:12:01,997
But the truth is, she's the one who
takes care of Grandpa and me.

149
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:15,200
Hey!

150
00:12:15,933 --> 00:12:17,900
Damn Sak wouldn't get off
my back about that card debt.

151
00:12:18,100 --> 00:12:20,066
Good thing Boss Chai bailed me out.

152
00:12:25,733 --> 00:12:26,533
Nant!

153
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,900
Change your clothes
and go see Boss Chai!

154
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:46,200
Why do I have to go see him?

155
00:12:46,733 --> 00:12:49,333
Because he bought you from me!

156
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:54,400
No!

157
00:12:55,933 --> 00:12:56,733
I'm not going!

158
00:12:57,400 --> 00:12:58,200
You have to go!

159
00:12:58,466 --> 00:12:59,266
I'm not going!

160
00:12:59,300 --> 00:13:00,333
If you don't go,

161
00:13:00,566 --> 00:13:01,900
we'll all starve to death!

162
00:13:02,100 --> 00:13:02,900
I'm not going!

163
00:13:03,266 --> 00:13:04,333
I said go.

164
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,400
Yot, take her!

165
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:06,989
Why do I have to go see Hia Chai?

166
00:13:06,989 --> 00:13:07,714
Go!

167
00:13:07,714 --> 00:13:08,442
Go!

168
00:13:08,442 --> 00:13:08,942
I'm not going!

169
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:09,766
Go! You have to go!

170
00:13:09,766 --> 00:13:10,266
I'm not going!

171
00:13:10,266 --> 00:13:11,100
Go! I told you to go!

172
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:12,000
I'm not going!

173
00:13:12,500 --> 00:13:14,066
Can you shut up?!

174
00:13:14,266 --> 00:13:14,766
Hey!

175
00:13:14,766 --> 00:13:16,100
I said go!

176
00:13:16,266 --> 00:13:16,766
I said go!

177
00:13:16,766 --> 00:13:17,266
Go!

178
00:13:17,333 --> 00:13:17,933
I'm not going!

179
00:13:17,933 --> 00:13:18,486
Go!

180
00:13:18,486 --> 00:13:19,700
I'm not going!

181
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:20,700
Watch where you're going.

182
00:13:21,566 --> 00:13:22,466
Mom,I don't want to go!

183
00:13:23,533 --> 00:13:24,333
Stand up straight!

184
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:25,400
Mom!

185
00:13:26,735 --> 00:13:27,899
I'm not going!

186
00:13:27,899 --> 00:13:29,500
Mom!

187
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:33,300
Remember this. Your only purpose
is to make money for me.

188
00:13:33,666 --> 00:13:34,333
No.

189
00:13:34,333 --> 00:13:37,366
Just think of it as paying me back
for pushing you out.

190
00:13:38,500 --> 00:13:39,300
Go!

191
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:42,600
Please.

192
00:13:43,133 --> 00:13:43,933
No!

193
00:13:58,666 --> 00:13:59,466
Help!

194
00:13:59,900 --> 00:14:00,700
Help!

195
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,466
Please help me!

196
00:14:06,766 --> 00:14:09,536
Please help me!

197
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,997
Help me, please!

198
00:14:22,766 --> 00:14:26,400
Hey, Nant. What's wrong?
Why are you running?

199
00:14:26,578 --> 00:14:28,447
Can you take me to Grandma's?

200
00:14:28,447 --> 00:14:33,400
Okay, okay. Don't be scared.
I'll take you there.

201
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:36,366
Why were you running away?

202
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:50,600
It's okay. Don't be scared.
I'll take you there.

203
00:15:00,666 --> 00:15:02,933
Nant! Come with me right now!

204
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:04,933
Nee!
Where are you taking my granddaughter?

205
00:15:05,966 --> 00:15:06,466
Nee!

206
00:15:06,466 --> 00:15:07,639
Mom, what are you doing?!

207
00:15:07,639 --> 00:15:08,139
Ow!

208
00:15:08,333 --> 00:15:09,133
Come with me right now!

209
00:15:09,300 --> 00:15:11,000
You can't just take her away again!

210
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:13,566
She's my daughter.
I can do whatever I want with her!

211
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:14,866
Come on!

212
00:15:14,866 --> 00:15:15,966
Stay out of this, Mom!

213
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:18,866
Go home, Nee!

214
00:15:19,700 --> 00:15:20,500
I'm not going back.

215
00:15:20,766 --> 00:15:21,800
If you want me to go back,

216
00:15:21,933 --> 00:15:23,200
I'm taking Nant with me.

217
00:15:23,700 --> 00:15:25,533
But you don't want her
to go with me, do you?

218
00:15:25,938 --> 00:15:28,330
Then hand over the title deed
to this land in exchange.

219
00:15:48,500 --> 00:15:49,533
I'd rather lose everything

220
00:15:49,866 --> 00:15:51,733
than let my granddaughter
go through hell again.

221
00:15:51,933 --> 00:15:52,766
Take it!

222
00:15:57,533 --> 00:15:58,333
Mom.

223
00:15:58,466 --> 00:15:59,566
Don't worry about me.

224
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:02,866
I promise I'll never set foot
in this house again.

225
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:05,533
Come on, darling.

226
00:16:06,066 --> 00:16:07,366
You ungrateful brat!

227
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:16,758
My poor girl...

228
00:16:17,755 --> 00:16:19,013
I'm sorry.

229
00:16:24,300 --> 00:16:25,000
Hello.

230
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,866
Oh, hello there, Chief.

231
00:16:26,866 --> 00:16:27,666
Hello.

232
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:31,133
I came here today to
tell you something.

233
00:16:31,666 --> 00:16:33,800
If Grandma pays back
the 600,000 baht you owe me,

234
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:35,933
I'll return the land title to her.

235
00:16:36,666 --> 00:16:38,133
But there's something
else I want to say.

236
00:16:38,866 --> 00:16:41,066
I'll even waive all the interest.
How about that?

237
00:16:42,300 --> 00:16:43,133
That's very kind of you.

238
00:16:43,900 --> 00:16:44,700
Thank you so much.

239
00:16:45,266 --> 00:16:47,300
Of course. We should help each other.

240
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:51,466
I'll find a way to pay you back, Uncle.

241
00:16:57,333 --> 00:16:59,800
I'll get the land back for you,
I promise.

242
00:17:02,366 --> 00:17:03,733
That's my girl.

243
00:17:17,566 --> 00:17:18,900
Ever since that day,

244
00:17:21,266 --> 00:17:26,566
Nant has felt like she's carrying
a heavy burden in her heart.

245
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:31,796
She wants to buy back the rice field

246
00:17:31,796 --> 00:17:34,686
so Grandpa can take care of it.

247
00:17:36,515 --> 00:17:38,114
And also to make up for...

248
00:17:39,107 --> 00:17:41,100
the mistake their parents caused.

249
00:17:52,666 --> 00:17:53,618
Chat...

250
00:17:54,872 --> 00:17:58,535
You can be angry with her.
You can hate her.

251
00:18:00,677 --> 00:18:03,600
But please don't hurt her.

252
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:11,166
I used to think badly of Nant too.

253
00:18:13,333 --> 00:18:14,133
But now...

254
00:18:16,333 --> 00:18:17,900
I understand, Grandma.

255
00:19:02,933 --> 00:19:03,733
Grandma!

256
00:19:05,366 --> 00:19:06,166
Grandma!

257
00:19:07,266 --> 00:19:08,066
Huh?

258
00:19:08,666 --> 00:19:10,300
Why is the house so quiet?

259
00:19:10,300 --> 00:19:11,066
Yeah.

260
00:19:11,566 --> 00:19:12,700
It's really quiet.

261
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:23,100
Uh...

262
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:25,500
What's going on here?

263
00:19:27,666 --> 00:19:28,666
Open it and see.

264
00:19:39,566 --> 00:19:40,733
It's the land title.

265
00:19:41,566 --> 00:19:44,300
I just took Grandma
to get it back from Chief.

266
00:19:47,800 --> 00:19:48,600
Boss...

267
00:19:51,200 --> 00:19:52,400
Why did you do that?

268
00:19:53,933 --> 00:19:54,733
Why?

269
00:19:55,300 --> 00:19:57,266
Didn't you want me to use your land

270
00:19:57,733 --> 00:19:59,566
for the banana-growing project?

271
00:20:00,066 --> 00:20:01,566
If someone else still owned it,

272
00:20:01,966 --> 00:20:02,966
how could I lease it?

273
00:20:04,900 --> 00:20:05,900
How did you know?

274
00:20:07,766 --> 00:20:11,166
I overheard you talking
to Grandpa earlier.

275
00:20:20,966 --> 00:20:23,600
Uh, I'll go prepare lunch.

276
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:26,500
(Grandpa) Bring the stuff here.
(Grandma) I'll carry them.

277
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,701
I'll help you carry these. Come on.

278
00:20:28,701 --> 00:20:30,202
Let's put everything upstairs.

279
00:20:30,202 --> 00:20:30,889
Come on, Grandma.

280
00:20:30,889 --> 00:20:31,600
I'll start cooking, dear.

281
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:36,900
I bought so much stuff.

282
00:20:42,533 --> 00:20:43,333
Well...

283
00:20:44,166 --> 00:20:45,466
Is there something you want to tell me?

284
00:20:49,266 --> 00:20:50,066
Boss...

285
00:20:51,900 --> 00:20:52,966
I'm sorry.

286
00:20:55,533 --> 00:20:59,766
I admit I really did bring you here
to look at the land.

287
00:21:01,700 --> 00:21:04,825
Mm-hmm. I figured

288
00:21:05,452 --> 00:21:08,966
you were hiding something from me,
you little brat.

289
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,466
You knew?

290
00:21:14,200 --> 00:21:14,790
Yes.

291
00:21:16,044 --> 00:21:20,100
But I never thought
you'd be this cruel to me.

292
00:21:24,966 --> 00:21:26,600
If you'd just told me the truth,

293
00:21:27,566 --> 00:21:29,466
I would've been willing
to help you, Nant.

294
00:21:32,933 --> 00:21:35,900
I was afraid you'd hate me, Boss.

295
00:21:37,700 --> 00:21:38,500
I...

296
00:21:39,166 --> 00:21:41,700
I didn't want you to think
I was some money-hungry woman.

297
00:21:44,766 --> 00:21:47,133
I've never thought of you that way.

298
00:21:48,300 --> 00:21:50,600
And I'm not mad at you
or hate you for it either.

299
00:21:52,366 --> 00:21:53,933
But what you did...

300
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:56,933
it still hurt my feelings a little.

301
00:22:03,766 --> 00:22:05,700
You wouldn't tell me anything.

302
00:22:07,466 --> 00:22:09,533
Don't ever do this again.

303
00:22:10,166 --> 00:22:10,966
Do you understand?

304
00:22:13,133 --> 00:22:14,366
I'm sorry, Boss.

305
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:19,133
What about the land, then?

306
00:22:21,333 --> 00:22:23,296
I didn't buy the land back for you.

307
00:22:24,236 --> 00:22:24,791
The land...

308
00:22:25,575 --> 00:22:27,375
I'm leasing the land
to grow bananas for five years,

309
00:22:27,375 --> 00:22:29,022
for a total of 600,000 baht.

310
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:31,860
As for the money you've been
paying in earlier installments,

311
00:22:32,800 --> 00:22:34,933
I've put all of it into
Grandma's bank account.

312
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:38,290
Wow.

313
00:22:38,551 --> 00:22:41,700
I'll find a way
to pay boss back in full.

314
00:22:43,366 --> 00:22:44,089
How?

315
00:22:44,716 --> 00:22:46,533
By taking those odd jobs?

316
00:22:49,366 --> 00:22:53,357
I don't want you doing anything
dangerous like that again.

317
00:22:53,879 --> 00:22:55,477
No more fake-girlfriend gigs.

318
00:22:55,999 --> 00:22:57,666
No more getting paid to
break couples up.

319
00:22:57,666 --> 00:23:00,993
And no more dangerous jobs of any kind.

320
00:23:01,515 --> 00:23:02,366
Understand?

321
00:23:04,166 --> 00:23:06,200
Then where am
I supposed to get the money?

322
00:23:08,533 --> 00:23:09,400
From me.

323
00:23:12,700 --> 00:23:15,733
Let me be...the only one who hires you.

324
00:23:29,600 --> 00:23:30,400
Why?

325
00:23:32,500 --> 00:23:34,510
What's wrong with that?

326
00:23:35,712 --> 00:23:39,245
If I'm your hirer,
I'll pay whatever you ask.

327
00:23:39,245 --> 00:23:41,828
It's better than you putting yourself
in danger again.

328
00:23:45,933 --> 00:23:47,266
Are you worried about me, Boss?

329
00:23:53,266 --> 00:23:54,066
Mm-hmm.

330
00:23:58,300 --> 00:23:59,100
Wow.

331
00:24:02,166 --> 00:24:04,000
Now that we've finished
discussing business...

332
00:24:07,566 --> 00:24:09,333
Shall we continue this in bed?

333
00:24:15,100 --> 00:24:17,966
Sure. You're feeling better now, right?

334
00:24:25,366 --> 00:24:26,166
No.

335
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:27,400
Actually, never mind.

336
00:24:28,100 --> 00:24:29,400
I'm going to punish you, Boss.

337
00:24:31,200 --> 00:24:33,200
About you doing things without
telling me.

338
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:36,766
You're quite the
grudge-holder, aren't you?

339
00:24:40,700 --> 00:24:42,066
But thank you, Boss.

340
00:24:43,133 --> 00:24:43,933
Thank you.

341
00:24:47,366 --> 00:24:48,166
Thank you.

342
00:24:48,966 --> 00:24:52,066
I only did it for your grandparents.

343
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:03,966
Come on, let's go inside.

344
00:25:07,766 --> 00:25:08,566
Let's go.

345
00:25:09,600 --> 00:25:10,400
No.

346
00:25:10,600 --> 00:25:11,290
Come on.

347
00:25:11,290 --> 00:25:12,400
You wouldn't let me kiss you earlier.

348
00:25:14,866 --> 00:25:15,666
Come on.

349
00:25:26,266 --> 00:25:28,466
Uh, I'm here for my scheduled
internal examination.

350
00:25:28,566 --> 00:25:30,733
Oh, sure. Please have a seat
and wait a moment.

351
00:25:30,966 --> 00:25:31,766
Okay.

352
00:25:59,300 --> 00:26:00,900
If you keep ignoring me like this,

353
00:26:01,500 --> 00:26:02,966
I'll kiss you right here.

354
00:26:03,333 --> 00:26:04,666
Kirin Ham Cheese.

355
00:26:06,466 --> 00:26:07,700
We don't even know each other.

356
00:26:09,466 --> 00:26:10,266
Don't know each other?

357
00:26:11,900 --> 00:26:14,300
Yet we kissed until our lips
were raw?

358
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:15,800
Hey, Doc!

359
00:26:16,800 --> 00:26:18,066
What the hell are you talking about?

360
00:26:19,266 --> 00:26:20,666
With a memory that short,

361
00:26:22,100 --> 00:26:23,533
I guess I'll have to refresh it.

362
00:26:27,266 --> 00:26:29,026
Our lips just bumped into each other.

363
00:26:29,026 --> 00:26:30,973
That's not called a kiss.

364
00:26:31,391 --> 00:26:32,700
It was an accident.

365
00:26:33,600 --> 00:26:34,706
Oh, really?

366
00:26:36,639 --> 00:26:39,266
Then, would you like
to try a French kiss?

367
00:26:44,800 --> 00:26:47,517
So, what's it going to be?

368
00:26:47,517 --> 00:26:49,499
Do you know me or not?

369
00:26:50,962 --> 00:26:53,800
It's your choice.
If you say you don't know me,

370
00:26:55,266 --> 00:26:57,695
next time I'll give you
a special internal exam.

371
00:26:58,531 --> 00:27:02,333
No instruments. Just my fingers and...

372
00:27:02,666 --> 00:27:03,466
Okay, okay!

373
00:27:04,566 --> 00:27:05,500
Fine! I know you.

374
00:27:07,500 --> 00:27:08,200
That's all it took.

375
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:09,266
What do you want from me?

376
00:27:09,766 --> 00:27:10,766
You perverted doctor.

377
00:27:12,066 --> 00:27:13,166
Nothing much.

378
00:27:13,766 --> 00:27:15,333
I just wanted to
ask you out for a meal.

379
00:27:16,733 --> 00:27:17,933
Don't you have any friends?

380
00:27:19,133 --> 00:27:20,666
I do, but none of them will come.

381
00:27:24,366 --> 00:27:26,733
Even your own friends
won't hang out with you.

382
00:27:30,533 --> 00:27:33,366
Oh, Dr. Air, you know this girl?

383
00:27:34,166 --> 00:27:34,966
No, I don't.

384
00:27:35,800 --> 00:27:37,370
There you go again.

385
00:27:37,683 --> 00:27:39,900
I just gave you an internal exam
just a few days ago.

386
00:27:40,933 --> 00:27:43,533
Fine! I know you.

387
00:27:45,300 --> 00:27:48,333
Uh, Ni, you can head back now.

388
00:27:48,566 --> 00:27:49,266
Sure.

389
00:27:49,266 --> 00:27:51,266
I need to talk to Dr. Ai
for a bit.

390
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,986
Okay, take your time.

391
00:27:52,986 --> 00:27:53,566
I'm off.

392
00:27:54,133 --> 00:27:54,753
Bye.

393
00:27:54,753 --> 00:27:55,253
Let's go.

394
00:27:59,166 --> 00:28:01,733
What's with them?
When did these two get so close?

395
00:28:14,566 --> 00:28:15,366
Hey, Doc.

396
00:28:17,100 --> 00:28:18,800
Why did you drag me here?

397
00:28:20,066 --> 00:28:21,300
Taking a trip down memory lane?

398
00:28:22,966 --> 00:28:23,766
Exactly.

399
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:25,333
We still haven't settled

400
00:28:26,166 --> 00:28:27,366
what happened that day.

401
00:28:29,866 --> 00:28:30,666
Well...

402
00:28:30,733 --> 00:28:31,800
Then hurry up and settle it.

403
00:28:32,533 --> 00:28:33,333
So I can go home.

404
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:35,200
Hmm.

405
00:28:35,566 --> 00:28:37,200
How should I settle it?

406
00:28:40,100 --> 00:28:41,533
That feeling from the other day...

407
00:28:42,500 --> 00:28:44,533
I can still feel it on my lips.

408
00:28:47,133 --> 00:28:49,333
What? Still thinking about it?

409
00:28:49,933 --> 00:28:50,733
Mm-hmm.

410
00:28:52,333 --> 00:28:55,333
Hey, Doc. What are you so hung up on?

411
00:28:56,100 --> 00:28:59,082
I can't help it.

412
00:28:59,082 --> 00:29:01,719
Because of your kiss, little girl.

413
00:29:04,866 --> 00:29:05,900
Are you a pervert or something?

414
00:29:06,866 --> 00:29:07,700
A little.

415
00:29:08,700 --> 00:29:09,500
I missed you.

416
00:29:10,200 --> 00:29:11,900
So I wanted to treat you
to a meal to make it up to you.

417
00:29:14,800 --> 00:29:16,000
What are you making it up for?

418
00:29:16,966 --> 00:29:18,348
Everything.

419
00:29:18,870 --> 00:29:21,235
The ham and cheese, the French fries...

420
00:29:21,235 --> 00:29:23,323
Everything I did that upset you.

421
00:29:23,323 --> 00:29:25,200
I just wanted to take you
out for a meal.

422
00:29:27,866 --> 00:29:31,559
So you think buying me dinner

423
00:29:31,559 --> 00:29:33,466
will make up for everything?

424
00:29:34,766 --> 00:29:37,166
Or would you prefer a
different kind of apology?

425
00:29:38,066 --> 00:29:39,700
Like...

426
00:29:39,700 --> 00:29:41,066
Kissing you back?

427
00:29:41,600 --> 00:29:44,866
Enough. Just buy me dinner.

428
00:29:46,966 --> 00:29:48,733
I'll eat until I'm stuffed.
Just you wait.

429
00:29:49,933 --> 00:29:50,733
Be my guest.

430
00:29:53,566 --> 00:29:59,366
So, why didn't you
invite your girlfriend instead?

431
00:29:59,933 --> 00:30:00,766
I'm single.

432
00:30:04,933 --> 00:30:05,800
You're good-looking.

433
00:30:07,300 --> 00:30:08,966
I never thought you'd still be single.

434
00:30:10,533 --> 00:30:12,933
I'd rather stay single forever
than end up with a player.

435
00:30:14,966 --> 00:30:15,766
Kirin...

436
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:21,466
I think I'm going to pursue you.

437
00:30:49,600 --> 00:30:50,400
Just a second.

438
00:30:55,866 --> 00:30:56,366
Ow.

439
00:30:56,366 --> 00:30:56,966
Careful.

440
00:30:59,700 --> 00:31:00,545
Are you okay?

441
00:31:01,590 --> 00:31:03,236
I'm fine.

442
00:31:06,100 --> 00:31:07,166
Go sit down.

443
00:31:19,300 --> 00:31:20,466
I've brought you home.

444
00:31:21,566 --> 00:31:22,700
Now I can leave.

445
00:31:29,800 --> 00:31:30,600
No.

446
00:31:31,266 --> 00:31:32,066
Hey!

447
00:31:34,333 --> 00:31:35,266
I'm not letting you go.

448
00:31:36,400 --> 00:31:37,500
Stay the night.

449
00:31:38,100 --> 00:31:39,466
I don't want to be alone.

450
00:31:40,600 --> 00:31:41,400
Hey, Doc.

451
00:31:42,200 --> 00:31:43,900
You're not exactly young anymore.

452
00:31:44,700 --> 00:31:45,933
Stop acting like a child.

453
00:31:50,100 --> 00:31:50,900
Let go.

454
00:31:52,600 --> 00:31:54,166
You're drunk and talking nonsense.

455
00:32:12,900 --> 00:32:14,400
I'm not that drunk.

456
00:32:19,066 --> 00:32:19,866
How can you say you're not drunk?

457
00:32:21,533 --> 00:32:23,666
Do you even realize what you're doing?

458
00:32:27,266 --> 00:32:28,066
Of course I do.

459
00:32:29,800 --> 00:32:30,600
Kirin...

460
00:32:32,100 --> 00:32:33,800
Can you kiss me one more time?

461
00:32:35,800 --> 00:32:37,533
A real kiss, not an accident.

462
00:32:50,133 --> 00:32:51,800
Why should I kiss you?

463
00:32:52,733 --> 00:32:53,533
Are you crazy?

464
00:33:02,566 --> 00:33:03,733
Then you should go home.

465
00:33:05,666 --> 00:33:06,733
I can manage on my own.

466
00:33:28,366 --> 00:33:30,133
Hey, Doc.
Are you really going to pursue me?

467
00:33:36,866 --> 00:33:37,666
Yes.

468
00:33:45,309 --> 00:33:46,679
I'm serious.

469
00:35:32,066 --> 00:35:34,800
Are you sure you want to do this?

470
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:40,466
If you let me, then I'm sure.

471
00:35:45,200 --> 00:35:46,766
I won't let you down.

472
00:36:48,133 --> 00:36:50,500
Hey! What the hell is going on here?

473
00:36:54,600 --> 00:36:56,000
What should we do?

474
00:36:56,600 --> 00:36:59,300
Obviously, we have to fix it!
Why even ask?

475
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:03,366
What about my room being broken into?

476
00:37:03,666 --> 00:37:05,280
Have you checked yet?

477
00:37:05,280 --> 00:37:06,766
Did anything of yours go missing?

478
00:37:07,500 --> 00:37:08,300
Nothing.

479
00:37:09,500 --> 00:37:10,700
I don't have anything valuable.

480
00:37:11,700 --> 00:37:13,466
What the hell? Someone broke into

481
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:15,200
the room but didn't take anything?

482
00:37:16,066 --> 00:37:16,866
Huh?

483
00:37:16,966 --> 00:37:19,466
Could it have been
one of your creditors?

484
00:37:20,100 --> 00:37:21,700
Do you have security footage
we can check?

485
00:37:22,066 --> 00:37:22,866
No cameras.

486
00:37:23,166 --> 00:37:24,266
You know that already.

487
00:37:26,666 --> 00:37:27,500
Then let's report it to the police.

488
00:37:27,866 --> 00:37:28,666
Hey, hey, hey!

489
00:37:29,000 --> 00:37:31,866
Don't get the police involved
in my apartment building!

490
00:37:32,100 --> 00:37:33,000
You know how it is here.

491
00:37:33,166 --> 00:37:34,500
You know who lives in my building.

492
00:37:35,066 --> 00:37:37,000
If the police start hanging around,

493
00:37:37,266 --> 00:37:39,333
all my tenants will be scared away!

494
00:37:39,566 --> 00:37:40,366
Huh?

495
00:37:40,466 --> 00:37:43,533
So what am I supposed to do?
I'm the victim here!

496
00:37:43,766 --> 00:37:46,724
Hey, hey! I'm the victim here!

497
00:37:47,312 --> 00:37:49,287
Just look at all the stuff in this room!

498
00:37:49,630 --> 00:37:52,866
I rented you the room,
and now you've gone and wrecked it!

499
00:37:54,366 --> 00:37:55,166
The repair costs...

500
00:37:55,400 --> 00:37:56,666
You're responsible for them.

501
00:37:58,533 --> 00:38:01,100
Uh, it comes to 25,000 baht in total.

502
00:38:03,000 --> 00:38:03,800
What?

503
00:38:04,800 --> 00:38:05,600
25,000?

504
00:38:06,166 --> 00:38:06,966
Hey!

505
00:38:07,066 --> 00:38:08,566
And let me warn you.

506
00:38:08,766 --> 00:38:10,566
If you go to the police,

507
00:38:10,866 --> 00:38:12,400
I'll kick you out immediately!

508
00:38:13,400 --> 00:38:15,166
I'll have a repairman come tomorrow.

509
00:38:15,700 --> 00:38:17,866
You'd better get the money ready.

510
00:38:18,466 --> 00:38:19,266
Otherwise...

511
00:38:19,500 --> 00:38:22,800
Pack your things
and get the hell out of my building!

512
00:38:23,566 --> 00:38:24,533
That's final!

513
00:39:16,966 --> 00:39:17,926
Good Lord!

514
00:39:18,448 --> 00:39:20,533
You look like a walking corpse, Nant.

515
00:39:21,366 --> 00:39:24,700
Yeah, did Boss Chat
suck the life right out of you?

516
00:39:26,566 --> 00:39:27,714
You don't look any better.

517
00:39:27,714 --> 00:39:29,766
You look like you
haven't slept all night, Ki.

518
00:39:32,266 --> 00:39:34,024
Whatever. Leave me alone.

519
00:39:35,278 --> 00:39:37,766
Anyway, what's going on with you?

520
00:39:40,500 --> 00:39:41,788
Hey...

521
00:39:42,624 --> 00:39:43,966
My room got broken into.

522
00:39:44,200 --> 00:39:45,700
What? Someone broke in?

523
00:39:47,000 --> 00:39:51,666
Yeah, but here's the weird part.
Nothing was stolen.

524
00:39:52,500 --> 00:39:56,200
Oh, Nant doesn't have
anything valuable, huh?

525
00:39:56,500 --> 00:39:58,133
Poor burglar!

526
00:39:59,666 --> 00:40:01,066
When are you getting it fixed?

527
00:40:02,166 --> 00:40:05,533
The landlord's making me
pay for the repairs.

528
00:40:06,966 --> 00:40:07,766
Sigh...

529
00:40:07,866 --> 00:40:08,666
How much?

530
00:40:12,786 --> 00:40:13,333
What?!

531
00:40:14,766 --> 00:40:15,566
25,000?!

532
00:40:16,400 --> 00:40:17,533
Why is it so expensive?

533
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:18,966
What the hell needs fixing?

534
00:40:19,566 --> 00:40:22,100
If I can't come up with the money,

535
00:40:22,766 --> 00:40:23,566
I'll...

536
00:40:24,266 --> 00:40:26,700
end up sleeping under a bridge.

537
00:40:36,666 --> 00:40:37,664
Hey...

538
00:40:38,395 --> 00:40:41,556
Could you lend me 25,000?

539
00:40:42,287 --> 00:40:45,351
I'll pay you back
at the end of the month.

540
00:40:51,900 --> 00:40:53,990
Look at this.

541
00:40:53,990 --> 00:40:55,419
Ever since the wedding,

542
00:40:55,419 --> 00:40:58,357
Ma's punished me
by giving me only 500 baht a day.

543
00:40:58,357 --> 00:41:01,366
I'm about to cry just talking about it.

544
00:41:03,933 --> 00:41:05,333
But I have 10,000 saved up.

545
00:41:06,000 --> 00:41:06,853
You can take that for now.

546
00:41:06,853 --> 00:41:08,333
Oh! No, I can't.

547
00:41:09,133 --> 00:41:10,166
How could I?

548
00:41:10,533 --> 00:41:12,366
I know that's your savings.

549
00:41:13,700 --> 00:41:15,100
You still have tuition to pay.

550
00:41:15,966 --> 00:41:16,766
I can't take it.

551
00:41:17,666 --> 00:41:18,600
What am I going to do?

552
00:41:25,900 --> 00:41:27,900
I know where you can get the money.

553
00:41:29,333 --> 00:41:30,133
Where?

554
00:41:30,266 --> 00:41:31,666
Boss Chat, obviously.

555
00:41:32,400 --> 00:41:33,600
Pleeease, Boss Chat!

556
00:41:34,333 --> 00:41:35,766
Someone broke into Nant's room.

557
00:41:36,166 --> 00:41:37,666
Could you give
her some money to fix it?

558
00:41:38,800 --> 00:41:39,600
Yeah, actually.

559
00:41:40,133 --> 00:41:41,400
25,000 baht is nothing to her.

560
00:41:42,466 --> 00:41:44,000
It's pocket change.

561
00:41:46,666 --> 00:41:49,733
No way. Boss Chat has
already helped me so much.

562
00:41:55,333 --> 00:41:56,666
How can I ask her for money?

563
00:41:57,600 --> 00:42:01,500
I just managed to prove to her
that I'm not some money-hungry woman.

564
00:42:02,933 --> 00:42:03,733
Besides...

565
00:42:04,966 --> 00:42:07,000
Boss already told me
not to take any more jobs.

566
00:42:08,466 --> 00:42:11,000
And now you want me
to go begging her for money?

567
00:42:16,300 --> 00:42:18,333
Sorry. I didn't think before I spoke.

568
00:42:25,966 --> 00:42:28,080
Look at you,
Miss Good, Miss Hard-Worker.

569
00:42:28,080 --> 00:42:29,933
You're about to be homeless tomorrow.

570
00:42:30,166 --> 00:42:31,464
Oh, shut up.

571
00:42:31,464 --> 00:42:33,133
You're just teasing her!

572
00:42:36,733 --> 00:42:37,733
It's okay.

573
00:42:40,766 --> 00:42:41,666
What am I supposed to do?

574
00:42:44,100 --> 00:42:44,966
Come here. There, there.

575
00:42:45,400 --> 00:42:47,100
It's okay.

576
00:43:02,612 --> 00:43:03,909
(Hello, Ms. Nant.)

577
00:43:04,448 --> 00:43:05,548
(My name is Wasu.)

578
00:43:05,842 --> 00:43:09,705
(I need someone to accompany me
to a business tycoon's daughter's party tonight.)

579
00:43:09,705 --> 00:43:11,096
(It's a formal event.)

580
00:43:11,586 --> 00:43:14,594
(You'll need to wear an evening gown
and mingle with the guests.)

581
00:43:14,985 --> 00:43:17,692
(I'd like you to attend as my daughter.)

582
00:43:18,062 --> 00:43:21,468
(The fee is 35,000 baht.
Would you be interested?)

583
00:43:21,933 --> 00:43:22,733
Wow!

584
00:43:23,333 --> 00:43:24,900
Why is the pay so high?

585
00:43:27,900 --> 00:43:30,133
It must be a pretty formal event, huh?

586
00:43:37,700 --> 00:43:39,498
No more fake-girlfriend gigs.

587
00:43:39,498 --> 00:43:41,548
No more getting paid to
break couples up.

588
00:43:41,548 --> 00:43:44,866
And no more dangerous jobs of any kind.

589
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:53,133
But if I don't take this job...

590
00:43:54,500 --> 00:43:56,666
I'll have nowhere to live.

591
00:44:08,016 --> 00:44:10,016
(Thitinant's Account Info)

592
00:44:11,184 --> 00:44:12,498
(Deposit received: 10,000 baht)

593
00:44:12,900 --> 00:44:13,700
Wow.

594
00:44:23,766 --> 00:44:29,266
I promise this will be my last job.

595
00:44:42,666 --> 00:44:43,966
It's a pleasure doing
business with you.

596
00:44:44,300 --> 00:44:45,100
Likewise.

597
00:45:07,866 --> 00:45:11,600
Uh, was there a problem
with the meeting just now, Boss?

598
00:45:14,000 --> 00:45:15,366
Oh, no.

599
00:45:26,700 --> 00:45:31,566
If there's anything you need help with,
just let me know, Boss.

600
00:45:36,200 --> 00:45:37,133
Anything at all?

601
00:45:38,100 --> 00:45:39,166
Work-related matters only.

602
00:45:39,933 --> 00:45:40,918
It's me, Chom.

603
00:45:40,918 --> 00:45:41,418
I knew it.

604
00:45:41,766 --> 00:45:44,466
Chat, I can help you with anything.

605
00:45:45,266 --> 00:45:46,066
No, thanks.

606
00:45:46,766 --> 00:45:48,066
I'd rather ask Hanna.

607
00:45:49,300 --> 00:45:52,000
But this isn't work-related.

608
00:45:53,933 --> 00:45:55,466
I wanted to ask you something.

609
00:45:56,200 --> 00:45:57,000
Oh...

610
00:45:57,266 --> 00:45:58,566
It's about a friend of mine.

611
00:45:59,066 --> 00:45:59,866
It's not about me.

612
00:46:00,300 --> 00:46:00,800
Okay.

613
00:46:00,800 --> 00:46:01,900
Which friend?

614
00:46:03,266 --> 00:46:03,766
Ugh!

615
00:46:03,766 --> 00:46:04,333
Hmph!

616
00:46:04,533 --> 00:46:05,927
I said it's a friend, so it's a friend!

617
00:46:05,927 --> 00:46:06,600
Okay.

618
00:46:07,266 --> 00:46:10,497
Let's say...

619
00:46:11,072 --> 00:46:15,826
If two people have feelings
for each other and they're apart,

620
00:46:16,296 --> 00:46:17,766
would one of them
usually reach out first?

621
00:46:18,866 --> 00:46:19,666
Hmm.

622
00:46:21,866 --> 00:46:23,649
If they know Boss is busy,

623
00:46:23,649 --> 00:46:27,166
maybe they want to wait
until Boss is free?

624
00:46:29,933 --> 00:46:32,067
But if it were me,

625
00:46:32,067 --> 00:46:36,166
I'd text every second, every breath.

626
00:46:36,933 --> 00:46:38,166
That'd be so annoying.

627
00:46:39,100 --> 00:46:42,966
Hanna, are you talking about me?
That hurts.

628
00:46:49,933 --> 00:46:50,766
Forget it.

629
00:47:00,500 --> 00:47:04,266
Hanna, do you
think Chat has a girlfriend?

630
00:47:17,946 --> 00:47:19,946
(Mom, Chat definitely
has a girlfriend.)

631
00:47:20,396 --> 00:47:21,766
Shit!

632
00:47:21,766 --> 00:47:22,566
Wrong chat!

633
00:47:26,050 --> 00:47:28,050
(Oh, I didn't know I had a girlfriend.)

634
00:47:28,051 --> 00:47:30,051
(Congratulations.)

635
00:47:37,800 --> 00:47:38,600
No need to delete it.

636
00:47:39,500 --> 00:47:40,566
Everyone's already read it.

637
00:47:41,400 --> 00:47:42,866
You must have a lot of free time, Chom.

638
00:47:43,533 --> 00:47:47,800
Then you're coming to work tomorrow.
Clock in at the office every morning.

639
00:47:48,366 --> 00:47:49,566
Oh, Chat!

640
00:47:50,333 --> 00:47:51,366
Hmph! No way.

641
00:47:51,800 --> 00:47:52,600
Yes, you will.

642
00:47:52,933 --> 00:47:53,733
Chat!

643
00:48:20,300 --> 00:48:22,000
There's a party inside, right?

644
00:48:22,533 --> 00:48:23,333
Yeah.

645
00:48:24,666 --> 00:48:25,800
Are you sure this is safe?

646
00:48:26,966 --> 00:48:29,266
The payment is suspiciously high.

647
00:48:29,700 --> 00:48:31,566
That's why I brought you guys along.

648
00:48:32,200 --> 00:48:34,300
Yeah, good thinking.
Don't let your guard down.

649
00:48:44,133 --> 00:48:44,933
Hello.

650
00:48:45,366 --> 00:48:46,166
Hello.

651
00:48:47,066 --> 00:48:48,266
Are you Ms. Nant?

652
00:48:48,466 --> 00:48:49,166
Yes.

653
00:48:49,166 --> 00:48:50,333
I'm Wasu.

654
00:48:51,100 --> 00:48:54,000
I'm the one who suddenly hired you
to play my daughter.

655
00:48:54,466 --> 00:48:55,621
Hello, Mr. Wasu.

656
00:48:55,621 --> 00:48:59,066
Oh, it's no trouble at all.
I'm more than happy to do it.

657
00:49:00,366 --> 00:49:01,933
Uh, and who are these two?

658
00:49:02,566 --> 00:49:04,700
Oh, they're my friends.

659
00:49:06,366 --> 00:49:07,503
What should we do?

660
00:49:07,503 --> 00:49:09,966
I'm afraid you can't enter
without an invitation.

661
00:49:10,566 --> 00:49:11,366
Oh...

662
00:49:13,066 --> 00:49:14,399
That's all right.

663
00:49:14,765 --> 00:49:16,342
We're just here to drop Nant off.

664
00:49:16,342 --> 00:49:18,566
Seeing that you're here
puts my mind at ease.

665
00:49:19,733 --> 00:49:20,533
Right.

666
00:49:21,666 --> 00:49:23,366
(Nant) Well, let's go inside.
(Kirin) Hey!

667
00:49:26,300 --> 00:49:28,031
If anything seems suspicious

668
00:49:28,031 --> 00:49:29,480
or you feel uncomfortable,

669
00:49:29,480 --> 00:49:30,800
call us, okay?

670
00:49:31,700 --> 00:49:33,700
Yeah, I doubt anything will happen.

671
00:49:35,100 --> 00:49:38,666
There are plenty of people around.
I'll call if anything comes up.

672
00:49:39,000 --> 00:49:40,100
Take care of yourself.

673
00:49:42,100 --> 00:49:43,066
Are you worried about me?

674
00:49:43,733 --> 00:49:45,133
Shall we go, Dad?

675
00:49:45,300 --> 00:49:46,100
Of course.

676
00:49:50,533 --> 00:49:52,466
You're almost done
with university, aren't you, Nant?

677
00:49:53,666 --> 00:49:56,966
Oh, yes. I'm doing
my internship right now.

678
00:49:57,266 --> 00:49:58,666
Wow, that must be exhausting.

679
00:49:58,966 --> 00:50:01,466
Not at all. I really enjoy working.

680
00:50:02,733 --> 00:50:06,100
Aren't you afraid
of taking jobs like this?

681
00:50:07,300 --> 00:50:09,533
Oh, I guess I've been lucky.

682
00:50:10,366 --> 00:50:12,133
I've only ever had good clients.

683
00:50:12,700 --> 00:50:14,078
I see.

684
00:50:14,078 --> 00:50:16,712
Once the event is over,

685
00:50:16,712 --> 00:50:20,300
I'll transfer the rest of your payment
right away.

686
00:50:20,900 --> 00:50:21,700
Okay.

687
00:50:22,133 --> 00:50:22,900
Let's go.

688
00:50:22,900 --> 00:50:23,700
Okay.

689
00:50:27,966 --> 00:50:29,123
Oh...

690
00:50:30,272 --> 00:50:31,671
Where are we going?

691
00:50:31,671 --> 00:50:36,200
Isn't the party on the fifth floor?

692
00:50:37,600 --> 00:50:40,318
Well, I'd like to take you

693
00:50:40,318 --> 00:50:42,039
to meet my wife first.

694
00:50:42,039 --> 00:50:44,533
We need to go over a few more details.

695
00:50:51,133 --> 00:50:54,000
Oh, I think we can talk right here.

696
00:50:55,466 --> 00:50:57,509
My wife isn't ready yet.

697
00:50:57,509 --> 00:50:59,400
But if you're uncomfortable...

698
00:51:00,266 --> 00:51:03,200
Yes, I'm uncomfortable.

699
00:51:05,266 --> 00:51:06,366
Since we've come all this way,

700
00:51:06,933 --> 00:51:08,566
let's just talk for a moment.

701
00:51:25,866 --> 00:51:27,019
Let me take this call.

702
00:51:27,019 --> 00:51:27,666
Yeah.

703
00:51:30,266 --> 00:51:32,400
Hello? What is it?

704
00:51:34,866 --> 00:51:35,666
Hey, Doc!

705
00:51:36,300 --> 00:51:37,100
What's wrong?

706
00:51:38,066 --> 00:51:39,266
Are you drunk?

707
00:51:39,733 --> 00:51:40,700
Where are you? I'll come get you.

708
00:51:41,066 --> 00:51:42,166
Okay, okay. I'm on my way.

709
00:51:43,466 --> 00:51:43,966
Yong.

710
00:51:43,966 --> 00:51:44,641
Huh?

711
00:51:44,641 --> 00:51:45,966
I have to go. Something urgent came up.

712
00:51:46,300 --> 00:51:48,600
Okay. I'll wait around here for Nant.

713
00:51:48,733 --> 00:51:51,266
Mm-hmm. I'm off. Keep an eye on her.

714
00:51:52,733 --> 00:51:53,933
Where's she rushing off to?

715
00:52:11,830 --> 00:52:15,299
Chat: (What are you up to?)

716
00:52:22,390 --> 00:52:31,539
Chat: (What's wrong?)

717
00:52:31,539 --> 00:52:34,567
Chat: (What's wrong?)
Chat: (Can I call you?)

718
00:52:49,900 --> 00:52:52,800
Sorry, the number you have dialed...

719
00:53:04,266 --> 00:53:06,466
Hello, Ms. Chat.
What can I do for you?

720
00:53:07,200 --> 00:53:11,166
Uh, I can't get hold of your friend.

721
00:53:12,066 --> 00:53:15,966
Oh, Nant is out on a
paid dinner engagement tonight.

722
00:53:19,133 --> 00:53:22,700
Hello? Ms. Chat, can you hear me?

723
00:53:24,400 --> 00:53:27,327
Yes. Please send me the location.

724
00:53:27,327 --> 00:53:28,466
Thank you.

725
00:53:45,100 --> 00:53:46,866
Hey! What the hell is this?

726
00:53:48,100 --> 00:53:48,900
What is going on?

727
00:53:50,066 --> 00:53:51,366
Once the job is done,

728
00:53:51,766 --> 00:53:53,500
I'll transfer the rest of your payment.

729
00:53:55,666 --> 00:53:56,466
What is this?

730
00:53:59,766 --> 00:54:01,266
What are you talking about, dear?

731
00:54:01,900 --> 00:54:02,700
Well, today...

732
00:54:03,100 --> 00:54:04,966
Didn't we make a deal?

733
00:54:05,966 --> 00:54:06,766
What are you talking about?

734
00:54:08,866 --> 00:54:09,800
Come on.

735
00:54:10,466 --> 00:54:12,000
Don't talk to me like that.

736
00:54:12,566 --> 00:54:14,133
You're breaking my heart.

737
00:54:15,000 --> 00:54:17,866
I'm already paid
the full amount upfront.

738
00:54:18,933 --> 00:54:19,766
Come on.

739
00:54:20,200 --> 00:54:21,733
Stop playing hard to get. Come here.

740
00:54:22,400 --> 00:54:23,200
Sit down.

741
00:54:23,700 --> 00:54:24,800
I'm not a hooker.

742
00:54:25,466 --> 00:54:26,466
With that much money,

743
00:54:26,766 --> 00:54:28,566
you could buy plenty of other women.

744
00:54:29,066 --> 00:54:30,866
Look, I'll transfer your money back.

745
00:54:31,133 --> 00:54:32,500
I'll transfer
your money back right now.

746
00:54:35,366 --> 00:54:36,307
No need!

747
00:54:37,247 --> 00:54:40,245
I like it when you play hard to get.

748
00:54:41,656 --> 00:54:43,366
Hey! Bring her over here.

749
00:54:52,066 --> 00:54:53,026
Don't be difficult.

750
00:54:53,026 --> 00:54:54,166
Don't be difficult with me, okay?

751
00:54:55,166 --> 00:54:56,266
Stay still!

752
00:55:02,900 --> 00:55:03,700
Chat!

753
00:55:03,933 --> 00:55:04,566
Chat!

754
00:55:04,566 --> 00:55:05,400
Chat, help me!

755
00:55:06,766 --> 00:55:08,366
Did she said, 'Chat, help me?'

756
00:55:17,966 --> 00:55:19,333
Go upstairs and help Nant right now.

757
00:55:19,800 --> 00:55:20,600
No questions. Move!

758
00:55:20,800 --> 00:55:21,600
Go!

759
00:55:24,400 --> 00:55:25,200
Hey, you!

760
00:55:27,566 --> 00:55:28,366
Let's go.

761
00:55:35,066 --> 00:55:35,866
Help!

762
00:55:36,333 --> 00:55:37,133
Help!

763
00:55:37,133 --> 00:55:38,866
Hey. Stay still, beautiful.

764
00:55:40,100 --> 00:55:40,900
Help me!

765
00:55:41,200 --> 00:55:43,766
This is exactly how I like it.

766
00:55:43,966 --> 00:55:44,866
What are you doing?!

767
00:55:45,900 --> 00:55:46,700
Help me!

768
00:55:51,600 --> 00:55:52,605
Who the hell are you?!

769
00:55:52,605 --> 00:55:53,887
Quiet!

770
00:55:54,866 --> 00:55:55,733
Why are you arresting me?

771
00:55:55,866 --> 00:55:57,100
I haven't done anything wrong!

772
00:55:57,266 --> 00:55:58,746
I paid for her!

773
00:55:58,746 --> 00:55:59,492
You bastard!

774
00:55:59,493 --> 00:56:00,553
You scumbag!

775
00:56:01,558 --> 00:56:03,192
You disgusting old pervert!

776
00:56:03,933 --> 00:56:05,113
Attempted rape,

777
00:56:05,113 --> 00:56:06,982
unlawful detention,

778
00:56:06,982 --> 00:56:09,933
and most importantly,
assaulting my girl.

779
00:56:12,595 --> 00:56:13,655
Yeah.

780
00:56:14,921 --> 00:56:16,921
What the hell can you do?

781
00:56:18,466 --> 00:56:19,304
Don't worry.

782
00:56:19,617 --> 00:56:22,200
I'll make sure you rot in prison.

783
00:56:22,201 --> 00:56:23,470
Take him away.

784
00:56:23,470 --> 00:56:24,530
Let go!

785
00:56:24,531 --> 00:56:26,113
Let me go!

786
00:56:26,113 --> 00:56:27,173
Hey!

787
00:56:27,237 --> 00:56:28,401
Do you know who I am?!

788
00:56:50,066 --> 00:56:50,805
Mr. Yong!

789
00:56:51,745 --> 00:56:54,800
Tell me what happened.

790
00:56:56,766 --> 00:56:57,431
Well...

791
00:56:58,215 --> 00:57:01,149
Her room was completely trashed.

792
00:57:01,880 --> 00:57:03,760
The landlord demanded compensation.

793
00:57:04,753 --> 00:57:05,955
She didn't have the money,

794
00:57:07,993 --> 00:57:09,694
so she took this job

795
00:57:09,694 --> 00:57:11,266
because she didn't want to trouble you.

796
00:57:14,366 --> 00:57:17,000
Her room was damaged?
What a coincidence.

797
00:57:17,500 --> 00:57:18,766
I thought so too.

798
00:57:19,966 --> 00:57:22,001
And the person who hired her...

799
00:57:22,001 --> 00:57:23,478
wasn't this old man.

800
00:57:23,948 --> 00:57:27,500
It was another man named Wasu.

801
00:57:29,666 --> 00:57:32,133
I think there's a whole scheme
behind all of this.

802
00:57:33,166 --> 00:57:35,766
I'll get to the bottom of it
and make sure they all go to prison.

803
00:57:45,200 --> 00:57:46,366
Don't cry anymore.

804
00:57:47,700 --> 00:57:48,533
Are you okay?

805
00:57:49,966 --> 00:57:51,166
Does anything hurt?

806
00:57:55,600 --> 00:57:56,400
Nant...

807
00:57:57,300 --> 00:57:58,100
Look at me.

808
00:57:58,800 --> 00:58:00,066
I'm right here.

809
00:58:02,113 --> 00:58:03,281
Didn't I tell you...

810
00:58:05,059 --> 00:58:07,059
I'm the only one who can hire you.

811
00:58:12,542 --> 00:58:14,542
It's okay, it's okay.

812
00:58:14,546 --> 00:58:15,971
I'm here.

813
00:58:33,569 --> 00:58:35,569
I'm here now. It's going to be okay.

814
00:59:54,538 --> 00:59:59,397
Chat:(Find me a good private
investigator for tomorrow.)

815
01:00:29,700 --> 01:00:31,593
I've been a lawyer for years,

816
01:00:31,593 --> 01:00:34,366
but this is the most despicable
case I've ever seen.

817
01:00:34,733 --> 01:00:36,652
The moment I saw Nant's photo

818
01:00:36,652 --> 01:00:38,800
at that hotel, I nearly lost my mind.

819
01:00:39,566 --> 01:00:41,866
Wait, is Boss seeing someone?

820
01:00:42,333 --> 01:00:44,466
I can't even imagine what Boss
would be like in a relationship.

821
01:00:45,200 --> 01:00:47,266
And after I've been so good to you...

822
01:00:48,200 --> 01:00:50,200
How do you think you should reward me?
